    "Name": "Mamono IFV",
    "Details": "The Mamono was designed to meet the needs of the Draconic Combine for a new infantry transport when it's tactical doctrine shifted to embrace Battle Armor. Tougher and better armed than the Goblin or Hasek it sports an 8 ton infantry bay and is capable of limited amphibious operation.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Reflective Coating\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       360     35\n<b>Left</b>         190     35\n<b>Right</b>       190     35\n<b>Rear</b>        150     35\n<b>Turret</b>      155     35\n\n<b>Total</b>      1045    175</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Communications</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 2 Battle Armor Squads. Has firing ports.</color>",
    "Icon": "MamonoIFV"
  },
